  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8f63df35-a9d1-4acf-bb60-fa9ed332fe49.png\"></p><p><strong>物品粉碎機</strong> 支援 ZombieCraft 的槍械包。（讓你能回收合成材料）</p><p>（回收率為 30-50%）<br><br><strong>如果未同時安裝任何一個選用相依模組，本模組將不會有任何作用！</strong></p><h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_15c85f09-3074-48f0-9d3e-a4abc25c6e7d.png\"></h2><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>必要模組：</strong></span></p><p><strong>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/item-scrapper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">物品粉碎機</a></strong> 作者：keerdm<br><br><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">選用模組：</span><br><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-the-division-gunpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Division 槍械包</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-guns-lesraisins-append-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lesraisins Append Pack</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maxstuff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Maxstuff</a><br></strong></p>",
